 CellTags->"c:83",ExpressionUUID->"fe1a8b13-333a-4024-9b40-6c8541119d74"],

Cell["\<\
Segment the hart according to the AH17 model and provide the segments as \
masks and radial sampleling points\
\>", "Text",
